  "import_id": "R-2026-09-09-004",
  "title": "Nutrition food composition v1 \u2014 USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy values for the golden card's ingredients (effective-dated, reviewed)",
  "sources": [
    "USDA FoodData Central, SR Legacy, retrieved 2026-09-09 via fdc.nal.usda.gov (verified per-food nutrient pages; FDC IDs recorded per entry)",
    "Fish = species UNKNOWN on the card: TWO SR Legacy entries loaded (cod, Atlantic, raw 171955 = lean class; mackerel, Atlantic, raw 175119 = oily class) so the View 9 energy band spans plausible classes; neither is marked primary. Sodium per class is retained in the food table \u2014 the golden View 9 'sodium Unknown' is the SPECIES-UNKNOWN consumption rule (D-19's I2 assumption handling), not a data falsification.",
    "Fenugreek POWDER has NO distinct USDA food record (SR Legacy, Foundation, and FNDDS datasets searched 2026-09-09 \u2014 only 'Spices, fenugreek seed' fdcId 171324 exists). Per I7, the powder line is therefore UNMAPPED: excluded from totals and listed, with this documented reason. The two-fenugreeks invariant is untouched (dictionary rows and allergen mappings remain distinct)."
  ],
